WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.686
A liquidation happens in seconds.

2
00:00:02.636 --> 00:00:06.522
Proving that an oracle fault caused an unfair loss takes evidence.

3
00:00:06.522 --> 00:00:12.204
POA helps protocol risk teams investigate a dispute and decide whether compensation is justified.

4
00:00:12.204 --> 00:00:17.045
This is a real Aave liquidation on Base, from May fourteenth, twenty twenty four.

5
00:00:17.045 --> 00:00:25.727
The hosted agent verifies the receipt, reconstructs every active borrower reserve, reads configured oracle sources, and compares historical exchange prices.

6
00:00:25.727 --> 00:00:28.090
Its evidence is downloadable.

7
00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.681
The architecture separates planning from financial decisions.

8
00:00:31.681 --> 00:00:35.306
A live Claude model chooses bounded, read-only tools.

9
00:00:35.306 --> 00:00:38.704
Code checks dependencies, amounts and block anchors.

10
00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:43.534
The model cannot sign a transaction, approve a treasury proposal, or send funds.

11
00:00:43.534 --> 00:00:47.284
Public visitors can run the rule planner without a model key.

12
00:00:47.284 --> 00:00:51.454
This borrower held USDC collateral and WETH debt.

13
00:00:51.454 --> 00:00:54.409
The baseline health factor was just below one.

14
00:00:54.409 --> 00:00:58.284
Five and thirty minute exchange averages gave conflicting answers.

15
00:00:58.284 --> 00:01:02.795
A healthy result under one average is not enough to prove an unfair liquidation.

16
00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:09.181
We reproduced the actual signed transaction in a local archive fork, after replaying its preceding block transaction.

17
00:01:09.181 --> 00:01:15.988
Gas use matches mainnet at eight hundred forty three thousand nine hundred twenty four, and all twenty five emitted logs match in order.

18
00:01:15.988 --> 00:01:20.090
Then we ran six price scenarios against the historical contracts.

19
00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:23.988
Both exchange spot price scenarios still liquidate the borrower.

20
00:01:23.988 --> 00:01:28.295
Three averaging scenarios block liquidation with Aave's health factor check.

21
00:01:28.295 --> 00:01:32.147
This demonstrates price sensitivity, not an oracle fault.

22
00:01:32.147 --> 00:01:38.386
Coinbase completed pre incident candles add market context; later trades are excluded from causal evidence.

23
00:01:38.386 --> 00:01:41.772
The hosted agent revalidates saved replay evidence.

24
00:01:41.772 --> 00:01:45.238
It does not claim to create a fresh fork on every request.

25
00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:48.965
The result is no compensation justified by this evidence.

26
00:01:48.965 --> 00:01:53.840
Observed transfer costs are reported separately from oracle attributable damage.

27
00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:58.590
That distinction protects a treasury from paying a persuasive but unsupported claim.

28
00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:03.022
Other transactions need their own replay and supported position analysis.

29
00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:06.147
Neatlogs records real tool and model calls.

30
00:02:06.147 --> 00:02:11.465
Fifteen recorded traces were read back from its server with their expected spans and parent links.

31
00:02:11.465 --> 00:02:15.647
A rejected model action remained visible, and the agent recovered.

32
00:02:15.647 --> 00:02:20.613
One hundred eighteen automated tests pass, including missing evidence and payout gates.

33
00:02:20.613 --> 00:02:25.249
Entire Graph helped locate the investigation code and inspect affected callers.

34
00:02:25.249 --> 00:02:28.511
We retain its actual output and coverage limits.

35
00:02:28.511 --> 00:02:34.534
The actual cfo dot ai plan models a protocol risk subscription, delivery costs, and runway.

36
00:02:34.534 --> 00:02:38.772
Pricing and opening cash are assumptions, not customers or revenue.

37
00:02:38.772 --> 00:02:44.522
A separate synthetic incident demonstrates the compensation path with test tokens and a sponsored claim.

38
00:02:44.522 --> 00:02:47.329
It is not a payout to this real borrower.

39
00:02:47.329 --> 00:02:51.386
POA makes the evidence, exclusions and decision inspectable.

40
00:02:51.386 --> 00:02:56.147
Try the live investigation, download the replay proof, and challenge the conclusion.
